1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,703
Push current the other way with an outside source, and you drive a non spontaneous reaction.

2
00:00:05,703 --> 00:00:11,927
That is an electrolytic cell, used for electroplating and extracting sodium and aluminium.

3
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:17,630
Notice: oxidation is always at the anode and reduction always at the cathode.

4
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,205
Only the signs swap.

